<title>FRANCE: Imetal Q1 sales rise to 2.3 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Imetal Q1 sales rise to 2.3 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 2,292    vs    1,897</p>
<p>NOTE - Imetal gave its sales figures in a statement. It said sales rose 1.9 percent on a like-for-like basis, or 20.8 percent using current exchange rates and group structure.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
